  "description": "Looking for a lightweight full-suspension eMTB? Moraine C Eagle 90 Transmission combines a carbon fiber frame with FAZUA’s light-torque Ride 60 drive unit. This gives you a nimble, playful ride backed by up to 60Nm of torque and a 480Wh internal battery.\n\nOur Split Pivot suspension design delivers efficient pedaling and reliable braking traction for the wide variety of terrain you’ll cover on Moraine. 145mm rear and 160mm front travel give you the confidence and control for the sendiest sections of trail.\n\nCargo mounts provide streamlined space for a bottle, multi-tool, pump, and spare tube for big days out. And SRAM’s Eagle 90 Transmission components make for a durable, precision-shifting mechanical drivetrain you can trust for adventures all over the mountain.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
